  "label": "The man's serious expression maps to the punchline 'because stressed spelled backwards is desserts'",
  "description": "The bottom panel of the image, showing the man with a serious, unsmiling expression, visually represents the 'mind = blown' reaction to the punchline. The text 'because stressed spelled backwards is desserts mind = blown.' is mapped onto this visual state, where the man's expression serves as the visual embodiment of the absurdity and surprise conveyed by the wordplay pun. The visual material (the man's serious face) is mapped onto the textual material (the punchline) to convey the comedic effect of the joke.",
